    "prompt = \"\"\"\n",
    "Hello Superwisor,\n",
    "\n",
    "I'm a second-year grad student in Computer Science with a focus on Machine Learning, and I'm starting my search for a new thesis supervisor. In my previous experience, my meetings with my supervisor were infrequent—about once every two months—which slowed down my research progress. Communication was primarily via email, and I often had to go through a PhD student to relay my queries. Although I appreciated the technical depth provided during our meetings, the lack of regular, direct interaction made it challenging to get timely feedback.\n",
    "\n",
    "For my upcoming thesis, I'm specifically interested in researching Adversarial Neural Networks. I'm looking for a supervisor who:\n",
    "- Has a strong background and research experience in Adversarial Neural Networks,\n",
    "- Regularly meets with their students (ideally weekly) to provide consistent guidance,\n",
    "- Offers prompt and direct communication (preferably via email or direct messaging),\n",
    "- Has an established track record of publishing high-quality research in this area,\n",
    "- Can provide both detailed technical insights and constructive feedback.\n",
    "\n",
    "Could you help me find potential supervisors from your database who fit these criteria?\n",
    "\n",
    "Thank you!\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "original_cv = \"\"\"\n",
    "---\n",
    "Education:\n",
    "- Master of Science in Data Science | Technion - Israel Institute of Technology | 2024 - Expected 2026  \n",
    "- Bachelor of Science in Data Science | Technion - Israel Institute of Technology | 2021 - 2024  \n",
    "\n",
    "Research Experience:\n",
    "- No information provided.  \n",
    "\n",
